      "content": "i've tried the small gestures and the responsibility stuff, but it just feels like i'm delaying the inevitable. it's like i'm just dragging out their misery. if i actually cared about them, wouldn't i want to give them their lives back? wouldn't the most decent thing to do be to just step out of the way so they can finally breathe without me?",
